eld; `threadNumbers.ts` merges a `mousedown` into the number gutter (a number starts a thread, the count badge toggles that line's threads; `pressedLine`: the empty line after a last newline and an empty column's line are no line of the file and do nothing) and draws the number plus the badge as a `lineNumberMarkers` marker; the hover icon is a `theme.css` mask from `--thread-icon`.
 
